# Only the root runtime SQLite dir — NOT nested data/ dirs, and NOT `data-pack/`, which is a
# different name entirely. The reference data pack must be in the build context: the api's
# `copy-data-pack` build step copies it into apps/api/dist/data-pack-bundled/, and that is the only
# copy the runtime image gets.
